      "content": "so if that's how it works, it's actually kind of creepy. it basically makes the whole room a giant listening device without even needing wires. \n\nif i wanted to test this, say, by whispering something near the edge of the fern circle, would the signal be strong enough at the center for someone to actually record it? and since it's \"organic,\" how would they actually convert those sound waves into a digital recording? would there be tiny sensors hidden in the soil or something?",
